WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two numbers appear in a stream of letters.
You catch the first. The second is gone.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Scientists call this the attentional blink.
No eyelid moves.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Training may change performance on this task
in some research settings.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
That does not prove any branded audio
recreates the result in twelve minutes.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before buying, check the actual files,
the evidence, and the refund terms.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try the free twelve-minute routine first.
Then decide for yourself.
